namespace EmcsfAcExtension

open MeasureTheory Set Filter Topology Complex
open scoped ENNReal

/-- The outgoing renormalized derivative `j = (1-μ)[∂_v(α/λ) - (λ/r)|θ/λ|²(θ/λ)]` (L4093–4095),
with the a.e. derivative along the outgoing section. -/
noncomputable def jOut (S : Fields) (u v : ℝ) : ℂ :=
  (1 - S.mu u v) * (deriv (S.a u) v -
    S.lam u v / S.r u v * ‖S.theta u v / S.lam u v‖ ^ 2 * (S.theta u v / S.lam u v))

end EmcsfAcExtension
